# The Celestial Nexus: another battlefieldWin (293, a GM) at the 32001 finish: the mission is not completed, but the
# char is set down in the Hall of the Gods all the same (the zone-out at the next tick).
lists Norg/Gilgamesh/onTrigger TheCelestialNexus/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=TheCelestialNexus pos=-580,-8,-30 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Zilart TheCelestialNexus current
login
trigger _513
update 32000 option=1
finish
bfwin                                   # a GM: WON, 32001
localvar battlefieldWin 293             # a GM
finish                                  # not completed; set down in the Hall of the Gods
tick 400
